   "text": "Keck Graduate Institute (KGI) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nKeck Graduate Institute (KGI)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nKGI, a member of The Claremont Colleges, is a recognized leader in biotechnology and healthcare education. KGI offers innovative postgraduate degrees and certificates that integrate life and health sciences, business, pharmacy, engineering, medicine, and genetics, focusing on industry projects, hands-on industry experiences, and team collaboration. With available industry connections, KGI provides pathways for students to become leaders within healthcare and the applied life sciences.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n07/04/2026 07:29\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n07/04/2026 07:29\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$51,705.00\nMin: US$32,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n10%\n65 of 657 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1997\nCampus(es)\nClaremont, California\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n Yes\nContract Start Date\n15/11/2024\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.kgi.edu/student-life/student-affairs/student-and-campus-life/campus-life/housing/\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.kgi.edu/admissions-and-aid/tuition-financial-aid/funding-your-degree/\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8n6h360kOJE\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\nApplication Fee - USD 75",
